menu "GAgent diagnostics"

config GAGENT_TRANSPORT_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool "Sample Worker and BLE transport performance"
    default n
    help
        Collect timing and traffic counters and print periodic INFO summaries.
        Disabled builds omit the sampling and counter storage entirely.

config GAGENT_CONTROL_LOG_DEBUG
    bool "Log successful control requests at DEBUG instead of INFO"
    default n
    help
        Reduce per-request logs for high-rate board protocols. Errors retain
        their original severity. Other boards keep normal control logs at INFO.

config GAGENT_MCU_DEBUG
    bool "Print MCU UART RX/TX bytes at INFO"
    default n
    help
        Print raw UART bytes in bounded hex/ASCII rows. RX is MCU to module;
        TX is module to MCU. Includes handshake, reports, commands, ACKs,
        heartbeats, OTA and board-specific serial exchanges. RX chunks may
        contain partial frames or multiple frames, including invalid data.
        Includes credentials carried on the wire. Requires INFO logging.

endmenu
